      "message": "This was an oversight from my previous CL that I caught after seeing some CTS failures. The bundle will have it\u0027s own indexing for the indirect draws it contains, [0..N], and if we increment the mNextIndirectDrawIndex with every *batch* then we\u0027ll wind up with holes in the indirect call indexing and `SetValidatedIndirectDrawArgs` will try indexing out of bounds. The solution is that we apply the same offset to the entire bundle.",
